---
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About Us - Vix Movies | Watch Movies & TV Shows Free</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Learn about Vix Movies, your premier destination for free high-definition movies, TV series, Bollywood, and Hollywood releases." />
    <style>
      body {
        background-color: #0b0f19;
        color: #f8fafc;
        font-family: 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0 15px 40px 15px;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      .page-card {
        background: #1e293b;
        border: 1px solid #334155;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 24px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      h1 {
        color: #38bdf8;
        font-size: 24px;
        margin-top: 0;
      }
      h2 {
        color: #f8fafc;
        font-size: 18px;
        margin-top: 20px;
      }
      p {
        color: #cbd5e1;
        font-size: 14px;
      }
      ul {
        color: #cbd5e1;
        font-size: 14px;
        padding-left: 20px;
      }
      li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <Navbar />

      <main class="page-card">
        <h1>About Vix Movies</h1>
        <p>Welcome to <strong>Vix Movies</strong>, your Ultimate Hub for discovering and streaming high-definition movies, trending TV series, Hollywood blockbusters, and Bollywood releases.</p>
        
        <h2>Our Mission</h2>
        <p>At Vix Movies, our mission is simple: To provide cinema lovers around the globe with seamless access to high-quality entertainment information, ratings, and instant streaming details with zero hassle.</p>

        <h2>Why Choose Vix Movies?</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Massive Catalog:</strong> From latest action hits to classic comedy, we index thousands of titles across diverse genres.</li>
          <li><strong>Real-time TMDB Data:</strong> Stay updated with live IMDb/TMDB ratings, release dates, and official trailers.</li>
          <li><strong>Multi-Device Responsive:</strong> Enjoy a lightning-fast experience customized for mobile phones, tablets, and desktops.</li>
          <li><strong>100% Free Access:</strong> Explore cinema trends without any subscription barriers.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Contact & Inquiries</h2>
        <p>We are constantly improving our platform. For suggestions, content inquiries, or technical assistance, feel free to reach out to our dedicated support team at <a href="mailto:brazilmarketing1@gmail.com" style="color: #38bdf8;">brazilmarketing1@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      </main>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
